For the powershell script to work you will have to: 
1. Download the file and put them both in "Documents"
2. In the same spot in file explorer go to new (dropdown menu) > select shortcut
3. You will need the file path click the powershell script > copy as path (ctrl + shift + c)
4. Paste this as the path: 
powershell.exe -WindowStyle Hidden -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File (copied file path here) 

If done correctly the icon should turn into the powershell logo 
